aka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202403/mob3tA8sj.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202403/mobYsgxQE.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202403/mobxeZRCY.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆったーり、まったーり、のんびーり、　ゆるーいペースで自然体にミーグリをさせていただいているので今日も楽にお越しくださいねーー。　　アイドル 田村保乃もありますが人間 田村保乃でいつもいるので、マイペースで、そのまますぎるかも。　　普段からか🙃　　はは　　ナチュラルにいられることが当たり前だとは勿論思っていないので、みんなにはとても感謝しています！　優しいせかいーーー　いつもありがとうね🧸　たのしもね　　ほなね！櫻坂46 田村保乃"}],"source":"official"},"ofc-s46-57500":{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202409/mobnalhB1.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ROCK IN JAPAN FESTIVAL 2024 in HITACHINAKA"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5年ぶりに\n茨城県の国営ひたち海浜公園にて開催という\n記念すべきタイミングに\n櫻坂46も出演させていただけて\n本当に光栄でした"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とてもとても楽しかったね〜〜〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました😌🌸"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202409/mobLDReQQ.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202409/mob7HRBvI.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202409/mob9fMB5D.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202409/mobNTtyrC.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうしても誰かに共感して欲しくて書くんですけど、笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"↑最後の写真あるじゃないですか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今朝 時間が早めだったことも\n曇っていたこともあって\n少し外が暗かったんですよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"薄暗く人もあまりいない開放的な空間に\n装飾の電気がキラキラしていて\n奥に観覧車が見えて、下は緑で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"映画「パレード」\nでみた景色とすっごいリンクしてしまって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"既視感というか、雰囲気がもうそんな感じ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これをずっと誰かに言いたかったんやけど、\n同じように思ったメンバーいたかな、、笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さがしてます。🥺笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それだけ😗笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202409/moblcCFrF.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202409/mobn2JrNJ.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202409/mobYr7aUL.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202409/mob3E0XuQ.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202409/mobAQ9u7Y.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202409/mobfqrzP9.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202409/mobW67u5o.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202409/mobpa0CQG.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ロッキン 引き続き\n最終日までお楽しみください"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2024年10月23日"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"櫻坂46 10枚目シングル\n「I want tomorrow to come」"},{"type":"break"},{"